lavender: power / volume keys (SPMI arbiter v3) and USB key commands

- bsd/dev/sweet_keys.c replaced: PM660 PON KPDPWR/RESIN (power, volume down), PM660L GPIO7
  (volume up), polled every 20 ms, read only
- sweet_usb.c: lv:power, lv:volup, lv:voldown, lv:home press that key for 120 ms
- made by xnu/src/mk_keys.py

